---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Split from '../components/Split.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How this website handles your information.">
  <header class="wrap page-title">
    <Split text="Privacy" class="display" />
    <p class="headline fade-in">Short and plain: this site collects as little as possible.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What this site stores</h2>
    <p>
      This website has no accounts, no tracking cookies and no analytics. It remembers one thing in your browser for the
      length of your visit: that you have already seen the loading screen, so it is not shown again.
    </p>

    <h2>The contact form</h2>
    <p>
      The form does not save or send anything to this website. When you press send, your message is handed to the app you
      choose to continue in (WhatsApp, your email app or Instagram), and the conversation continues there under that
      service's own privacy policy. Your details are only used to reply to your enquiry.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which means your browser connects to Google's servers. Links to Instagram,
      WhatsApp or YouTube take you to those services, which have their own policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Artwork images</h2>
    <p>
      All paintings and photographs on this site are the work and property of {site.fullName}. Please do not reproduce them
      without permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      To ask about your information or anything on this page, <a href="/contact" class="link">get in touch</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated {new Date().getFullYear()}.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-title .headline {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: calc(64ch + var(--gutter) * 2);
    padding-bottom: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px);
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin: 40px 0 12px;
  }
  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
</style>
